{
  "info": {
    "name": "AI Prediction, News & HR Analytics API",
    "description": "API lengkap untuk Pipeline Data (ETL & ELT), Prediksi AI, dan Manajemen Autentikasi (API Key & JWT Bearer).\n\n**Path A (ETL):** Scraped articles → cleaned → loaded\n**Path B (ELT):** Raw CSV → loaded → SQL transforms\n**Path C (AI & Data):** AI Sentiment Prediction & Reference Products Data\n\n## Setup\n1. Set `base_url` variable (default: http://localhost:8000)\n2. Jalankan request \"Get JWT Token\" di folder Auth terlebih dahulu — script test akan otomatis menyimpan token ke variabel `jwt_token`\n3. Protected endpoints dapat diakses menggunakan API Key (`X-API-Key`) atau JWT Bearer Token\n4. Nilai `api_key`, `client_id`, dan `client_secret` sudah disesuaikan dengan konfigurasi `.env`\n\n## Auth Methods\n- **API Key:** Header `X-API-Key`\n- **JWT Bearer:** POST `/token` → gunakan token di header `Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
